From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: musa <musa@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:19:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA: broadcast MRv2 PP sampled outputs over Gloo

Back PPHandler.broadcast_group with a sibling Gloo CPU subgroup on MUSA,
pack sampled tokens and counts into pre-allocated pinned ring buffers, and
wait on D2H completion via GIL-releasing musaEventSynchronize so cross-step
feedback collectives neither contend on GPU streams nor stall Python worker
threads. Join the sender thread and drain pending CPU broadcast handles
during GPUModelRunner.shutdown().
---
 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_runner.py |   2 +
 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/pp_utils.py     | 245 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 234 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

